d="00:56.010">this </span><span begin="00:56.010" end="00:56.340">car </span><span begin="00:56.340" end="00:57.240">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.360" end="01:00.900"><span begin="00:57.360" end="00:57.570">But </span><span begin="00:57.570" end="00:57.840">man</span><span begin="00:57.840" end="00:57.840">, </span><span begin="00:57.840" end="00:57.900">I </span><span begin="00:57.900" end="00:58.200">got </span><span begin="00:58.200" end="00:58.440">these </span><span begin="00:58.440" end="00:59.310">demons </span><span begin="00:59.310" end="00:59.550">and </span><span begin="00:59.550" end="00:59.640">they </span><span begin="00:59.640" end="01:00.030">telling </span><span begin="01:00.030" end="01:00.210">me </span><span begin="01:00.210" end="01:00.300">to </span><span begin="01:00.300" end="01:00.900">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.410" end="01:04.800"><span begin="01:01.410" end="01:01.890">Further </span><span begin="01:01.890" end="01:02.370">into </span><span begin="01:02.370" end="01:02.490">the </span><span begin="01:02.490" end="01:03.180">night </span><span begin="01:03.180" end="01:03.420">so </span><span begin="01:03.420" end="01:03.570">the </span><span begin="01:03.570" end="01:03.900">further </span><span begin="01:03.900" end="01:04.200">I </span><span begin="01:04.200" end="01:04.800">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.270" end="01:10.230"><span begin="01:06.270" end="01:06.540">I'm </span><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:06.930">down </span><span begin="01:06.930" end="01:07.140">on </span><span begin="01:07.140" end="01:07.260">my </span><span begin="01:07.260" end="01:08.130">knees</span><span begin="01:08.130" end="01:08.130">, </span><span begin="01:08.130" end="01:08.370">yeah </span><span begin="01:08.370" end="01:08.490">I'm </span><span begin="01:08.490" end="01:10.230">paranoid</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.260" end="01:14.220"><span begin="01:10.260" end="01:10.530">Don't </span><s